<title>INDONESIA: Modern Land says '96 net sharply down.</title>
<headline>Modern Land says '96 net sharply down.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to December 1996</p>
<p>				    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 14.2	vs     23.0</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)   126	vs	 213</p>
<p>    Revenue			  134.79	vs    169.14</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    71.73	vs     75.65</p>
<p>    Operating profit		41.12	vs     43.40</p>
<p>    Profit before income tax    20.12	vs     33.87</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     86.63	vs     78.23</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were audited. PT Modern Land, a member of the Modern Group, is a property company.</p>
</text>
